@startuml sequence-3-order
!include style.iuml
title Turn 7: choose, lock price and prepare (3 of 4)
mainframe sd TakeOrderAndPrepare
hide footbox
participant "ui : ConsoleUI" as UI <<boundary>>
participant "controller :\nTurnController" as TC <<control>>
participant "waiter : Waiter" as W
participant "state : GameState" as S
participant "c3 :\nRegularCustomer" as C3
participant "o3 : Order" as O3
participant ":Money" as M
participant "chef : Chef" as Chef
autonumber
[-> UI ++ : run(controller) [turn-7 excerpt]
== WAITER phase; C3 seated with no order ==
UI -> TC ++ : submit(Action(WAITER, ORDER, "C3"))
TC -> W ++ : takeOrder(state, "C3")
W -> S ++ : menu()
S --> W -- : menu
W -> C3 ++ : chooseMeal(menu)
C3 --> W -- : Salad + Pasta combo
note right of C3 : Polymorphic choice: Regular index 3 selects\nthe offered combo. No controller type check.
W -> S ++ : nextOrderId()
S --> W -- : "O3"
W -> C3 ++ : discountPercent()
C3 --> W -- : 0
W -> S ++ : turn()
S --> W -- : 7
W -> S ++ : happyHourActive()
S --> W -- : true
create O3
W --> O3 ++ : new Order("O3", "C3", combo, 0, 7, true)
O3 -> M ++ : applyDiscount(2430, 0)
M --> O3 -- : 2430
O3 -> M ++ : applyDiscount(2430, 20)
M --> O3 -- : 1944
O3 --> W -- : constructed (billCents = 1944)
note right of O3 : PLACED; 0/3 units. Bill is final.\nCombo base: (900 + 1800) * 90% = 2430.
W -> S ++ : addOrder(o3)
S --> W -- : void
W -> C3 ++ : attachOrder(o3)
C3 --> W -- : void
W --> TC -- : accepted order event ($19.44)
TC -> S ++ : setPhase(CHEF)
S --> TC -- : void
TC --> UI -- : ActionResult
== CHEF phase; same-turn order may be prepared ==
UI -> TC ++ : submit(Action(CHEF, PREPARE, "O3"))
TC -> Chef ++ : prepare(state, "O3")
Chef -> O3 ++ : advanceOneUnit(7)
O3 --> Chef -- : void
note right of O3 : PREPARING, 1/3 units; not servable.
Chef --> TC -- : accepted progress event
TC -> S ++ : setPhase(TURN_END)
S --> TC -- : void
TC --> UI -- : ActionResult
note over W, O3
  Checks precede nextOrderId(); rejected orders cannot skip an ID.
  Routine eligibility/accessor calls are omitted. Money methods are static.
  Customer stores Order but never calls it; Order/Money own bill arithmetic.
  Dashed new messages create objects; other dashed arrows return/output.
end note
note left of UI : run(controller) continues in PlayGame;\nthis diagram shows only the turn-7 excerpt.
deactivate UI
@enduml
